\newlabel{fig:power}{{12}{11}{The blind test is powered to resolve roughly \mde \pp , not the 3\pp {} it observes. Under the measured discordance rate, separating the learned trigger from periodic sampling at that magnitude would require about \nForObserved {} episodes per arm}{figure.caption.28}{}}
